* sshsig detached\nsignatures
** Operations
*** ssh-keygen -Y sign
*** -Y verify
*** -Y check-novalidate
*** -Y find-principals
*** -Y match-principals
** Armoured file
*** BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE
*** base64, wrapped at 76
*** detached only
** Blob fields
*** SSHSIG preamble
*** version, public key
*** namespace, reserved
*** hash algorithm
*** signature
** Signed pre-image
*** preamble, namespace,\nreserved, hashalg
*** hash of the message,\nnot the message
*** version and key are\nnot signed
** Namespace
*** mandatory, never empty
*** compared by equality
*** mismatch is\nSIGNATURE_INVALID
*** git uses "git"
** Trust
*** allowed_signers file
*** principals patterns\nmatched against -I
*** cert-authority delegation
*** sha256 or sha512 only
